Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 19:52:35 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 40/42] LAN game: chat box (Tab), lines of up to 32 characters
 in the players' colours

The box has the frame of the game's boxes and the background of the start
box; it is drawn again only when it changes. A line goes at once, not in a
turn (it does not change the game). draw_box_frame cuts its sides for a low
box.

